@0    = ~You betrays Ariena! Ariena will KILL YOU ALL!~
@1    = ~She is wanted alive for the Prisoners' Carnival! Hurt her in the beginning, but only pound on her after she is weakened!~
@2    = ~She is a beast! I must flee!~
@3    = ~Do not come back and expect payment!~
@4    = ~Ha! She is wearing down. We will take her yet!~
@5    = ~Wait, to strike all at once. Remember, alive! Mage, stand ready to teleport us!~
@6    = ~Me hate you <CHARNAME>! If Ariena comes back, me kill you!~
